5,1,1,talk,May,,"I need to see the ward complaint log and the frontage measurements. One household has carried this burden for years, and I want to know if the new plan actually changes that.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,The corner is unbearable in August. I’ll check the station block’s bin house and the truck arrival time. I need to know if a new structure just traps the smell or if timing helps.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried about the bill. I’ll look at the ward subsidy and the block ledger. We need to know what this costs us all before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,Two of us haven’t spoken since the last row. I’ll check the residents’ meeting statements and the station block’s minutes. I need to know if we can still talk after this.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I’ve watched this lane wear people down. I’ll check the ward filing requirements and the supervised mornings. I need to know the real hours this takes out of us.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, checking the ledger is smart. But if the costs are hidden, the burden stays unequal. I hope the numbers show who’s really paying.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, the numbers matter, but the smell matters more. If the new spot is just a box for the stink, we’ve failed.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, I agree! But if the subsidy covers most of it, maybe we can afford a better solution. Let’s see what the money says.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, knowing the hours is crucial. If it’s too much work, people will resent each other again. We need a system that doesn’t burn us out.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Midori, exactly. Resentment is the real cost. I want to see if the paperwork alone is enough to break us before we even start.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I’m picking the ward complaint log and the measurements of the five frontages. I need to see the history and the physical reality.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I’ll check the visit to the station block's bin house and the truck arrival time from the crew leader. I need to know the truth about the smell and the schedule.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I’ll check the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs and the block ledger of refuse-point expenses. I need to know the true financial picture.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Midori,,I’ll check the statements at the residents' meeting and the station block's meeting minutes. I need to see how they handled the fallout.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
