60,3,1,talk,May,,Option A rotates the burden. Option B keeps it static but adds oversight. Option C is a permanent trap. I want to see who carries the worst end.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,Option C is a box for the smell. Option B means waking up at seven. Option A moves the problem. I need to know which one is least annoying to live beside.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Kenji,,Option C costs the most. Option B adds labor. Option A is free but chaotic. I need to know which one protects the budget.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
